"id":"rensu-a-4c79d07b081961af07a3","label":"正文","text":"贼失妻子者皆还求降，郑浑责其得他妇女然后还其妻子，转相寇盗、党与离散","evidence":["rensu-q-eb2d4760426991a408e2"]},{"id":"rensu-a-ddf9e31c51c429f4e118","label":"正文","text":"郑浑遣吏民有恩信者分布山谷告喻，出者相继，使诸县长吏各还本治安集","evidence":["rensu-q-2a6b6e7f6fd7f4b4b888"]},{"id":"rensu-a-e2ac53389fff1eed3804","label":"正文","text":"梁兴等惧，将余众聚鄜城","evidence":["rensu-q-074028a5c3370c981e5f"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wendi-p0084","role":"主议者；组织守御逐贼者；责还妻子者；遣告者","evidence":["rensu-q-54593bada7f9d789bef9","rensu-q-62df42f9b62dbc9cf424","rensu-q-eb2d4760426991a408e2","rensu-q-2a6b6e7f6fd7f4b4b888"]},{"person":"wudi-p0287","role":"党众离散之寇首；聚鄜城者","evidence":["rensu-q-eb2d4760426991a408e2","rensu-q-074028a5c3370c981e5f"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["rensu-q-54593bada7f9d789bef9","rensu-q-62df42f9b62dbc9cf424","rensu-q-eb2d4760426991a408e2","rensu-q-2a6b6e7f6fd7f4b4b888","rensu-q-074028a5c3370c981e5f"]},"ordering_evidence":"rensu-q-54593bada7f9d789bef9","source_order":[16,318,47],"order":3447},{"id":"rensu-e-o117","title":"贼靳富等胁将夏阳长、邵陵令并吏民入硙山","accounts":[{"id":"rensu-a-56da68fca14144873647","label":"正文","text":"贼靳富等胁将夏阳长、邵陵令并吏民入硙山","evidence":["rensu-q-5ae98e56ad24ef9be51c"]},{"id":"rensu-a-5ede2fbe52e61af15b2c","label":"正文","text":"郑浑讨击破靳富等，获二县长吏，将其所略还","evidence":["rensu-q-59fc9068219b73dff53d"]},{"id":"rensu-a-69936c341678698f6994","label":"正文","text":"赵青龙杀左内史程休，郑浑遣壮士就枭其首","evidence":["rensu-q-a4b3e3d5ac337251c60c"]}],"participants":[{"person":"rensu-p0061","role":"胁将者；被破者","evidence":["rensu-q-5ae98e56ad24ef9be51c","rensu-q-59fc9068219b73dff53d"]},{"person":"wendi-p0084","role":"讨击者；遣壮士枭首者","evidence":["rensu-q-59fc9068219b73dff53d","rensu-q-a4b3e3d5ac337251c60c"]},{"person":"rensu-p0048","role":"杀人者","evidence":["rensu-q-a4b3e3d5ac337251c60c"]},{"person":"rensu-p0042","role":"被杀者","evidence":["rensu-q-a4b3e3d5ac337251c60c"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本