52e577556fa5225","label":"正文","text":"郑浑躬率吏民兴立功夫，一冬间皆成；比年大收，顷亩岁增，租入倍常；民刻石颂之，号曰\"郑陂\"","evidence":["rensu-q-9198cbf44f7b6ceb4a2b"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wendi-p0084","role":"兴陂主政者；躬率兴修者","evidence":["rensu-q-0ed38237e575e30b127c","rensu-q-9198cbf44f7b6ceb4a2b"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["rensu-q-0ed38237e575e30b127c","rensu-q-9198cbf44f7b6ceb4a2b"]},"ordering_evidence":"rensu-q-0ed38237e575e30b127c","source_order":[16,340,29],"order":3456},{"id":"rensu-e-o127","title":"郑浑以百姓苦乏材木，课树榆为篱、并益树五果；榆皆成藩五果丰实，村落齐整如一，民得财足用饶","accounts":[{"id":"rensu-a-49529f6ac8fe9f940553","label":"正文","text":"郑浑以百姓苦乏材木，课树榆为篱、并益树五果；榆皆成藩五果丰实，村落齐整如一，民得财足用饶","evidence":["rensu-q-fff02036da3bae4fe679"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wendi-p0084","role":"课树者","evidence":["rensu-q-fff02036da3bae4fe679"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["rensu-q-fff02036da3bae4fe679"]},"ordering_evidence":"rensu-q-fff02036da3bae4fe679","source_order":[16,341,15],"order":3457},{"id":"rensu-e-o128","title":"明帝闻郑浑之治，下诏称述，布告天下","accounts":[{"id":"rensu-a-04ade09b74ddf9779316","label":"正文","text":"明帝闻郑浑之治，下诏称述，布告天下","evidence":["rensu-q-e70a583943216ce4f92b"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wendi-p0005","role":"下诏称述者","evidence":["rensu-q-e70a583943216ce4f92b"]},{"person":"wendi-p0084","role":"受称述者","evidence":["rensu-q-e70a583943216ce4f92b"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["rensu-q-e70a583943216ce4f92b"]},"ordering_evidence":"rensu-q-e70a583943216ce4f92b","source_order":[16,342,0],"order":3458},{"id":"rensu-e-o130","title":"郑浑卒，以子郑崇为郎中","accounts":[{"id":"rensu-a-9cb80433b07fdcf25709","label":"正文","text":"郑浑卒，以子郑崇为郎中","evidence":["rensu-q-ee502ff192832890dc92"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wendi-p0084","role":"卒者","evidence":["rensu-q-ee502ff192832890dc92"]},{"person":"rensu-p0052","role":"受任郎中者","evidence":["rensu-q-ee502ff192832890dc92"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["rensu-q-ee502ff192832890dc92"]},"ordering_evidence":"rensu-q-ee502ff192832890dc92","source_order":[16,342,35],"order":3459}],"persons":[{"id":"wendi-p0084","name":"郑浑","evidence":["wendi-q-p032","rensu-q-55032501933ccba60d0e","rensu-q-ea3bc4874160c901ba70","rensu-q-ae9cc98e4d652dfa911d","rensu-q-54593bada7f9d789bef9","rensu-q-62df42f9b62dbc9cf424","rensu-q-eb2d4760426991a408e2","rensu-q-2a6b6e7f6fd7f4b4b888","rensu-q-1459a5cde62b2017fc1d","rensu-q-59fc9068219b73dff53d","rensu-q-a4b3e3d5ac337251c60c","rensu-q-b01320d93c49f143731c","rensu-q-9b6bea889be5192f3167","rensu-q-22b7241f34b8d67908cf","rensu-q-b44e478eacfaddfdcb28","rensu-q-0ed38237e575e30b127c","rensu-q-9198cbf44f7b6ceb4a2b","rensu-q-fff02036da3bae4fe679","rensu-q-e70a583943216ce4f92b","rensu-q-ee502ff192832890dc92","rensu-q2-b712ee83355dead2a981","rensu-q2-8abbae99597427b32df2","rensu-q2-03d45217496fc759e00e","rensu-q-db7af93a747447ade944","rensu-q2-ec01fe58e3ef16f03598","rensu-q2-1cc376112e86efb5edc1","rensu-q2-60bb8eca256b29a94654"],"facts":[{"id":"rensu-f2-23cc04cd7c0f3944eb40","text":"曹操辟为掾，出为下蔡长，迁邵陵令。","evidence":["rensu-q2-b712ee83355dead2a981"]},{"id":"rensu-f2-0236cc7dfaaf7f7983dd","text":"为丞相掾属，迁左冯翊。","evidence":["rensu-q2-8abbae99597427b32df2"]},{"id":"rensu-f2-406b92d8d1d991ca5e82","text":"为上党太守，后还为丞相掾。","evidence":["rensu-q2-03d45217496fc759e00e"]},{"id":"rensu-f2-5b7463c75b232bf4b4bf","text":"《续汉书》记兴字少赣，为谏议大夫；众字子师，为大司农。","evidence":["rensu-q-db7af93a747447ade944"]},{"id":"rensu-f2-dab089690f1b56d0f16e","text":"曾任侍御史、驸马都尉、阳平及沛郡太守。","evidence":["rensu-q2-ec01fe58e3ef16f03598"]},{"id":"rensu-f2-f33fe34db3ba2a936b38","text":"转山阳、魏郡太守。","evidence":["rensu-q2-1cc376112e86efb5edc1"]},{"id":"rensu-f2-d0e3fcc54460d32e231f","text":"迁将作大匠。","evidence":["rensu-q2-60bb8eca256b29a94654"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wendi-m-p032-wendi-p0084","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wendi-q-p032"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"rensu-q-074028a5c3370c981e5f","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-378150ee4e7d9cb9e894","layer":"original","quote":"兴等惧，将余众聚鄜城","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":317,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":245,"end":255},{"id":"rensu-q-0ed38237e575e30b127c","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-3162d819a45ee9752dd7","layer":"original","quote":"郡界下湿，患水涝，百姓饥乏。浑于萧、相二县界，兴陂堨，开稻田。郡人皆以为不便，浑曰：“地势洿下，宜溉灌，终有鱼稻经久之利。此丰民之本也","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":339,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":29,"end":96},{"id":"rensu-q-1459a5cde62b2017fc1d","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-948242ed44c316c89dfe","layer":"original","quote":"太祖使夏侯渊就助郡击之；浑率吏民前登，斩兴及其支党","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":318,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":25},{"id":"rensu-q-22b7241f34b8d67908cf","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-8b0314e2caae378c57a6","layer":"original","quote":"及大军入汉中，运转军粮，为最","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":319,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":84,"end":98},{"id":"rensu-q-2a6b6e7f6fd7f4b4b888","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-378150ee4e7d9cb9e894","layer":"original","quote":"又遣吏民有恩信者，分布山谷告喻。出者相继，乃使诸县长吏，各还本治以安集之","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":317,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":208,"end":244},{"id":"rensu-q-42866a87f5753636abb3","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-378150ee4e7d9cb9e894","layer":"original","quote":"时梁兴等略吏民五千余家，为寇抄；诸县不能御，皆恐惧，寄治郡下","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":317,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":13,"end":43},{"id":"rensu-q-54593bada7f9d789bef9","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-378150ee4e7d9cb9e894","layer":"original","quote":"议者悉以为“当移就险”，浑曰：“兴等破散，窜在山阻。虽有随者，率胁从耳。今当广开降路，宣喻恩信；而保险自守，此示弱也","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":317,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":47,"end":105},{"id":"rensu-q-55032501933ccba60d0e","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-0ec29c53f32db50fc2e0","layer":"original","quote":"浑将泰小子袤，避难淮南，袁术宾礼甚厚","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":315,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":68,"end":86},{"id":"rensu-q-59fc9068219b73dff53d","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-948242ed44c316c89dfe","layer":"original","quote":"浑复讨击破富等，获二县长吏，将其所略还","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":318,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":53,"end":72},{"id":"rensu-q-5ae98e56ad24ef9be51c","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-948242ed44c316c89dfe","layer":"original","quote":"又贼靳富等，胁将夏阳长、邵陵令并其吏民入硙山","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":318,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":26,"end":48},{"id":"rensu-q-62df42f9b62dbc9cf424","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-378150ee4e7d9cb9e894","layer":"original","quote":"乃聚敛吏民，治城郭，为守御之备。遂发民逐贼，明赏罚，与要誓；其所得获，十以七赏。百姓大悦，皆愿捕贼，多得妇女、财物","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":317,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":107,"end":164},{"id":"rensu-q-9198cbf44f7b6ceb4a2b","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-3162d819a45ee9752dd7","layer":"original","quote":"遂躬率吏民，兴立功夫〖2〗，一冬间皆成。比年大收，顷亩岁增，租入倍常。民赖其利，刻石颂之，号曰“郑陂”","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":339,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":98,"end":149},{"id":"rensu-q-9b6bea889be5192f3167","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-8b0314e2caae378c57a6","layer":"original","quote":"浑以百姓新集，为制移居之法：使兼复者与单轻者相伍〖14〗，温信者与孤老为比；勤稼穑，明禁令，以发奸者。由是民安于农，而盗贼止息","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":319,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":20,"end":83},{"id":"rensu-q-a4b3e3d5ac337251c60c","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-948242ed44c316c89dfe","layer":"original","quote":"及赵青龙者，杀左内史程休〖13〗。浑闻，遣壮士就枭其首","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":318,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":73,"end":100},{"id":"rensu-q-ae9cc98e4d652dfa911d","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-1345dcf058a2b69c56be","layer":"original","quote":"浑所在夺其渔猎之具，课使耕桑；又兼开稻田，重去子之法〖8〗。民初畏罪，后稍丰给，无不举赡。所育男女，多以“郑”为字","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":316,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":61,"end":118},{"id":"rensu-q-b01320d93c49f143731c","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-8b0314e2caae378c57a6","layer":"original","quote":"太祖征汉中，以浑为京兆尹","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":319,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":7,"end":19},{"id":"rensu-q-b44e478eacfaddfdcb28","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-8b0314e2caae378c57a6","layer":"original","quote":"又遣民田汉中〖15〗，无逃亡者","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":319,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":99,"end":114},{"id":"rensu-q-db7af93a747447ade944","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-ba53ee36d8b508d29bf7","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《续汉书》曰：“兴，字少赣。谏议大夫。众，字子师。大司农。”","attribution":"裴注（引书见引句）","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":337,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-a8c5edee652612b287f4","start":0,"end":33},{"id":"rensu-q-e70a583943216ce4f92b","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-83cb66985124cfab4a3d","layer":"original","quote":"明帝闻之，下诏称述，布告天下","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":341,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":14},{"id":"rensu-q-ea3bc4874160c901ba70","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-0ec29c53f32db50fc2e0","layer":"original","quote":"浑知术必败，时华歆为豫章太守，素与泰善，浑乃渡江投歆","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":315,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":87,"end":113},{"id":"rensu-q-eb2d4760426991a408e2","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-378150ee4e7d9cb9e894","layer":"original","quote":"贼之失妻子者，皆还求降。浑责其得他妇女〖10〗，然后还其妻子；于是转相寇盗，党与离散","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":317,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":165,"end":207},{"id":"rensu-q-ee502ff192832890dc92","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-83cb66985124cfab4a3d","layer":"original","quote":"及卒，以子崇为郎中","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":341,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":35,"end":44},{"id":"rensu-q-fff02036da3bae4fe679","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-dd156987cfbab57521c0","layer":"original","quote":"又以郡下百姓，苦乏材木，乃课树榆为篱，并益树五果〖3〗；榆皆成藩，五果丰实。入魏郡界，村落齐整如一，民得财足用饶","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":340,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":15,"end":71},{"id":"rensu-q2-03d45217496fc759e00e","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-8b0314e2caae378c57a6","layer":"original","quote":"转为上党太守。太祖征汉中，以浑为京兆尹。浑以百姓新集，为制移居之法：使兼复者与单轻者相伍〖14〗，温信者与孤老为比；勤稼穑，明禁令，以发奸者。由是民安于农，而盗贼止息。及大军入汉中，运转军粮，为最。又遣民田汉中〖15〗，无逃亡者。太祖益嘉之，复入为丞相掾。","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":319,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":128},{"id":"rensu-q2-1cc376112e86efb5edc1","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-dd156987cfbab57521c0","layer":"original","quote":"转为山阳、魏郡太守，其治仿此。又以郡下百姓，苦乏材木，乃课树榆为篱，并益树五果〖3〗；榆皆成藩，五果丰实。入魏郡界，村落齐整如一，民得财足用饶。","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":340,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":72},{"id":"rensu-q2-60bb8eca256b29a94654","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-83cb66985124cfab4a3d","layer":"original","quote":"明帝闻之，下诏称述，布告天下。迁将作大匠。浑清素在公，妻子不免于饥寒。及卒，以子崇为郎中。﹝一﹞","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":341,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":48},{"id":"rensu-q2-8abbae99597427b32df2","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-378150ee4e7d9cb9e894","layer":"original","quote":"辟为丞相掾、属，迁左冯翊。时梁兴等略吏民五千余家，为寇抄；诸县不能御，皆恐惧，寄治郡下〖9〗。议者悉以为“当移就险”，浑曰：“兴等破散，窜在山阻。虽有随者，率胁从耳。今当广开降路，宣喻恩信；而保险自守，此示弱也。”乃聚敛吏民，治城郭，为守御之备。遂发民逐贼，明赏罚，与要誓；其所得获，十以七赏。百姓大悦，皆愿捕贼，多得妇女、财物。贼之失妻子者，皆还求降。浑责其得他妇女〖10〗，然后还其妻子；于是转相寇盗，党与离散。又遣吏民有恩信者，分布山谷告喻。出者相继，乃使诸县长吏，各还本治以安集之。兴等惧，将余众聚鄜城〖11〗。","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":317,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":260},{"id":"rensu-q2-b712ee83355dead2a981","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-1345dcf058a2b69c56be","layer":"original","quote":"太祖闻其笃行，召为掾。复迁下蔡长、邵陵令〖4〗。天下未定，民皆剽轻〖5〗，不念产殖〖6〗。其生子无以相活，率皆不举〖7〗。浑所在夺其渔猎之具，课使耕桑；又兼开稻田，重去子之法〖8〗。民初畏罪，后稍丰给，无不举赡。所育男女，多以“郑”为字。","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":316,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":119},{"id":"rensu-q2-ec01fe58e3ef16f03598","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-3162d819a45ee9752dd7","layer":"original","quote":"文帝即位，为侍御史，加驸马都尉。迁阳平、沛郡二太守〖1〗。郡界下湿，患水涝，百姓饥乏。浑于萧、相二县界，兴陂堨，开稻田。郡人皆以为不便，浑曰：“地势洿下，宜溉灌，终有鱼稻经久之利。此丰民之本也。”遂躬率吏民，兴立功夫〖2〗，一冬间皆成。比年大收，顷亩岁增，租入倍常。民赖其利，刻石颂之，号曰“郑陂”。","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":339,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":150},{"id":"wendi-e-p032a-q","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-672630f578f395129508","layer":"pei","quote":"癸丑，宣告群僚。督军御史中丞司马懿，侍御史郑浑、羊祕、鲍勋、武周等言：“令如左。伏读太史丞许芝上符命事。臣等闻有唐世衰，天命在虞；虞氏世衰，天命在夏。然则天地之灵，历数之运，去就之符，惟德所在。故孔子曰：‘凤鸟不至，河不出《图》，吾已矣夫！’今汉室衰，自安、和、冲、质以来，国统屡绝；桓、灵荒淫，禄去公室。此乃天命去就，非一朝一夕，其所由来久矣。殿下践阼，至德广被，格于上下；天人感应，符瑞并臻。考之旧史，未有若今日之盛。夫大人者，先天而天弗违；后天而奉天时。天时已至而犹谦让者，舜、禹所不为也；故生民蒙救济之惠，群类受育长之施。今八方颙颙，大小注望；皇天乃眷，神人同谋；十分而九以委质，义过周文，所谓过恭也。臣妾上下，伏所不安。”","attribution":"裴注·献帝传","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":144,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-fc6f9c6942b5c231c294","start":0,"end":316},{"id":"wendi-q-b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：黄初二年（公元 221）。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":210,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-8fff547b113ffa36bbc1","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"wendi-q-o002","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-1c3ea4f0ea338bf2ec5a","layer":"original","quote":"太祖崩，嗣位为丞相，魏王。﹝三﹞尊王后曰王太后〖5〗。改建安二十五年为延康元年。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":40},{"id":"wendi-q-o019","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-8820e5c7f9006d364c44","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖1〗，郊祀天地、明堂〖2〗。甲戌〖3〗，校猎至原陵〖4〗。遣使者，以太牢祠汉世祖〖5〗。乙亥〖6〗，朝日于东郊〖7〗。﹝一﹞初令郡国口满十万者〖8〗，岁察孝廉一人；其有秀异〖9〗，无拘户口。辛巳〖10〗，分三公户邑，封子弟各一人为列侯。壬午〖11〗，复颍川郡一年田租〖12〗。﹝二﹞改许县为许昌县。以魏郡东部为阳平郡〖13〗，西部为广平郡〖14〗。﹝三﹞","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":208,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":183},{"id":"wendi-q-p032","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-672630f578f395129508","layer":"pei","quote":"癸丑，宣告群僚。督军御史中丞司马懿，侍御史郑浑、羊祕、鲍勋、武周等言：“令如左。伏读太史丞许芝上符命事。臣等闻有唐世衰，天命在虞；虞氏世衰，天命在夏。然则天地之灵，历数之运，去就之符，惟德所在。故孔子曰：‘凤鸟不至，河不出《图》，吾已矣夫！’今汉室衰，自安、和、冲、质以来，国统屡绝；桓、灵荒淫，禄去公室。此乃天命去就，非一朝一夕，其所由来久矣。殿下践阼，至德广被，格于上下；天人感应，符瑞并臻。考之旧史，未有若今日之盛。夫大人者，先天而天弗违；后天而奉天时。天时已至而犹谦让者，舜、禹所不为也；故生民蒙救济之惠，群类受育长之施。今八方颙颙，大小注望；皇天乃眷，神人同谋；十分而九以委质，义过周文，所谓过恭也。臣妾上下，伏所不安。”","attribution":"裴注·献帝传","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":144,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-fc6f9c6942b5c231c294","start":0,"end":316},{"id":"wudi-e-o137b-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-f4c8ba9bf8d7f6ff8015","layer":"original","quote":"马超余众梁兴等，屯蓝田〖6〗，使夏侯渊击平之。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":105,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":51,"end":74},{"id":"wudi-q-b-d1b3bd1bb0408268b940","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-d1b3bd1bb0408268b940","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗十七年：建安十七年（公元 212）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":127,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-32846c231ed2b04de76f","start":0,"end":21},{"id":"wudi-q-o137","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-f4c8ba9bf8d7f6ff8015","layer":"original","quote":"十七年春正月〖1〗，公还邺。天子命公赞拜不名〖2〗，入朝不趋〖3〗，剑履上殿〖4〗：如萧何故事〖5〗。马超余众梁兴等，屯蓝田〖6〗，使夏侯渊击平之。割河内之荡阴、朝歌、林虑〖7〗，东郡之卫国、顿丘、东武阳、发干〖8〗，巨鹿之廮陶、曲周、南和、广平、（之）任（城）〖9〗，赵之襄国、邯郸、易阳，以益魏郡〖10〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":105,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":155}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
